{"id":"43425fa1-18a8-4ebe-995e-466a914f67da","slug":"ig9000","model":"IG9000","name":"IG9000 超声波物位计","shortDescription":"通过超声波传播时间测量液体及散料物位，无需与介质直接接触。提供一体式与分体式结构，结合信号分析及温度补偿，适用于水处理、储罐等物位监测。","featured":false,"category":{"slug":"industrial","brand":null,"name":"工业测量","description":null,"seo":{"title":"工业测量","description":null,"imageUrl":null,"index":true}},"heroImage":{"id":"485bff13-2df9-448f-a8bc-6b60b3e5ad76","kind":"IMAGE","originalName":"2025040851503805.png","mimeType":"image/png","size":698863,"sha256":"8ef050d2f42f424a5466c7f703dc0ddcbb2915dc23bdee338481847f3cefa2dd","width":2604,"height":1704,"url":"/igenu-preview/media/8ef050d2f42f424a5466c7f7.png","createdAt":"2026-10-20T17:32:39.690Z","variants":[{"width":320,"height":209,"mimeType":"image/webp","url":"/igenu-preview/media/63971d02adf57bfde6335036.webp"},{"width":640,"height":419,"mimeType":"image/webp","url":"/igenu-preview/media/94e5c9a427aaff2e7fe15add.webp"},{"width":960,"height":628,"mimeType":"image/webp","url":"/igenu-preview/media/6403302113043098a393f716.webp"},{"width":1280,"height":838,"mimeType":"image/webp","url":"/igenu-preview/media/bd1f66f7ac71cc90284d1d8d.webp"},{"width":1600,"height":1047,"mimeType":"image/webp","url":"/igenu-preview/media/0f4d290e7e86d3dd29596237.webp"}]},"detailLayout":"STRUCTURED","availableLocales":["zh-CN","de","en"],"description":null,"bodyHtml":"<p><strong><span>产品特点：</span></strong></p><p>◆一体式、分体式可选，适用于不同现场安装要求 </p><p>◆主机可单通道、双通道可选，可实现多点测量、报警等功能 </p><p>◆使用简洁，结果可靠，界面操作指示可以减少操作失误 </p><p>◆探头材质有POM、PVDF、PTFE可选，适用于多种工况场合 </p><p>◆内部集成温度传感器，可实时对声速进行温度补偿</p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong><span>应用领域：</span></strong></p><p>政污水、工业废水 、环境监测 、饮用及地表水监测 、工业过程</p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong><span>技术参数：</span></strong></p><p><strong>一体式</strong></p><p>电源：DC18-36V；AC90-260V</p><p>输出：0/4-20mA;RS485(选配) </p><p>量程：0~5/10/15/20m </p><p>精度：0.25%（量程） </p><p>分辨率：1mm </p><p>盲区：0.3~0.6（视量程） </p><p>显示类型：128*64LCD（中英文、回波信号） </p><p>显示模式：液位、空距 </p><p>过程温度：-30℃~80℃ </p><p>防护等级：IP68（线径7-12mm）</p><p>电气接口：M20*1.5 </p><p>控制：2路可编程继电器 </p><p>故障报警：有</p><p>信号搜索：该功能能够有效应对泡沫和垃圾漂浮物等信号反射不良场合</p><p><strong>分体式</strong></p><p>电源：DC18-36V；AC90-260V</p><p>输出：2路0/4-20mA;RS485(选配) </p><p>量程：0~5/10/15/20m </p><p>精度：0.25%（量程） </p><p>分辨率：1mm 盲区：0.3~0.6（视量程）</p><p>显示类型：192*64LCD（中英文、回波信号） </p><p>显示模式：液位、空距 </p><p>过程温度：变送器：-30℃~80℃；传感器：-40℃~80℃ </p><p>防护等级：变送器：IP65；传感器：IP68（线径7~ 12mm） </p><p>电气接口：M20*1.5 </p><p>控制：4路可编程继电器 </p><p>故障报警：有 </p><p>信号搜索：该功能能够有效应对泡沫和垃圾漂浮物等信号反射不良场合</p><br /><p></p>\n    ","gallery":[],"features":[],"specificationGroups":[{"name":"一体式","specifications":[{"key":"integrated.power-supply","label":"电源","value":"DC18-36V；AC90-260V","unit":null},{"key":"integrated.output","label":"输出","value":"0/4-20mA;RS485(选配)","unit":null},{"key":"integrated.measurement-range","label":"量程","value":"0~5/10/15/20m","unit":null},{"key":"integrated.accuracy","label":"精度","value":"0.25%（量程）","unit":null},{"key":"integrated.resolution","label":"分辨率","value":"1mm","unit":null},{"key":"integrated.blind-zone","label":"盲区","value":"0.3~0.6（视量程）","unit":null},{"key":"integrated.display","label":"显示类型","value":"128*64LCD（中英文、回波信号）","unit":null},{"key":"integrated.display-mode","label":"显示模式","value":"液位、空距","unit":null},{"key":"integrated.process-temperature","label":"过程温度","value":"-30℃~80℃","unit":null},{"key":"integrated.protection","label":"防护等级","value":"IP68（线径7-12mm）","unit":null},{"key":"integrated.connection","label":"电气接口","value":"M20*1.5","unit":null},{"key":"integrated.control","label":"控制","value":"2路可编程继电器","unit":null},{"key":"integrated.fault-alarm","label":"故障报警","value":"有","unit":null},{"key":"integrated.signal-search","label":"信号搜索","value":"该功能能够有效应对泡沫和垃圾漂浮物等信号反射不良场合","unit":null}]},{"name":"分体式","specifications":[{"key":"split.power-supply","label":"电源","value":"DC18-36V；AC90-260V","unit":null},{"key":"split.output","label":"输出","value":"2路0/4-20mA;RS485(选配)","unit":null},{"key":"split.measurement-range","label":"量程","value":"0~5/10/15/20m","unit":n